{"id":"498c1bab1b62f288","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md","title":"ZFC Seq Sequence Length","display":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-length — ZFC Seq Sequence Length","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-length — ZFC Seq Sequence Length","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]","[[58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-length — ZFC Seq Sequence Length"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"870a865cad3f0fc0\" href=\"?note=870a865cad3f0fc0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\ell\\in V\">\\(s,\\ell\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span> is the graph-domain operator from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"870a865cad3f0fc0\" href=\"?note=870a865cad3f0fc0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}length} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S(\\ell,s)\\leftrightarrow \\ell\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\ell\\land\\exists A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S(s,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}length} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S(\\ell,s)\\leftrightarrow \\ell\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\ell\\land\\exists A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S(s,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph-domain operator is now a direct dependency rather than an undeclared symbol reached only indirectly through the finite-sequence predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","statu